#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:4
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, rate limiting prevents your Mattermost "
"server from being overloaded with too many requests, and decreases the "
"risk and impact of third-party applications or malicious attacks on your "
"server."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서, 속도 제한은 OKR.BEST 서버가 너무 많은 요청으로 과부하되는 것을 방지하고, 서버에 대한 타사 애플리케이션 또는 악의적인 공격의 위험과 영향을 줄입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:6
msgid ""
"Configure rate limiting settings by going to **System Console > "
"Environment > Rate Limiting**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file as "
"described in the following tables. Changes to configuration settings in "
"this section require a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr "**관리자 도구 > Environment > Rate Limiting**으로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 속도 제한 설정을 구성합니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정 변경 사항은 적용되기 전에 서버 재시작이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:10
msgid ""
"Mattermost rate limiting configuration settings are intended for small "
"deployments of Mattermost up to a few hundred users, and is not intended "
"for larger, Enterprise-scale deployments."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 속도 제한 구성 설정은 최대 수백 명의 사용자를 가진 소규모 OKR.BEST 배포를 위한 것이며, 대규모 Enterprise 규모 배포를 위한 것이 아닙니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:22
msgid "Enable rate limiting"
msgstr "속도 제한 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:25
msgid ""
"Enable or disable rate limiting to throttle APIs to a specified number of"
" requests per second."
msgstr "API를 초당 지정된 요청 수로 제한하도록 속도 제한을 활성화 또는 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:28
msgid ""
"**true**: APIs are throttled at the rate specified by the `Maximum "
"queries per second <#maximum-queries-per-second>`__ configuration "
"setting."
msgstr "**true**: API는 `초당 최대 쿼리 <#maximum-queries-per-second>`__ 구성 설정으로 지정된 속도로 제한됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:31
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** API access isn’t throttled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** API 접근이 제한되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:25
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:45
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:66
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:87
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:114
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:135
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:156
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Rate Limiting**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Rate Limiting**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:26
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:27
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_ENABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_ENABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:42
msgid "Maximum queries per second"
msgstr "초당 최대 쿼리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:45
msgid ""
"Throttle the API at this number of requests per second when `rate "
"limiting <#enable-rate-limiting>`__ is enabled."
msgstr "`속도 제한 <#enable-rate-limiting>`__이 활성화된 경우 API를 초당 이 요청 수로 제한합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:48
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **10**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **10**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:50
msgid ""
"Increase this value to accept more requests each second, and decrease "
"this value to allow fewer requests."
msgstr "매초 더 많은 요청을 수락하려면 이 값을 늘리고, 더 적은 요청을 허용하려면 이 값을 줄입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:46
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``PerSec`` > ``10``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``PerSec`` > ``10``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:47
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_PERSEC``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_PERSEC``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:63
msgid "Maximum burst size"
msgstr "최대 버스트 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:66
msgid ""
"The maximum number of requests allowed beyond the per second query limit "
"when `rate limiting <#enable-rate-limiting>`__ is enabled."
msgstr "`속도 제한 <#enable-rate-limiting>`__이 활성화된 경우 초당 쿼리 한도를 초과하여 허용되는 최대 요청 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:70
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **100**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **100**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:72
msgid ""
"Increase this value to allow for more concurrent requests to be handled, "
"and decrease this value to limit this capacity."
msgstr "더 많은 동시 요청을 처리할 수 있도록 이 값을 늘리고, 이 용량을 제한하려면 이 값을 줄입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:67
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``MaxBurst`` > ``100``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``MaxBurst`` > ``100``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:68
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_MAXBURST``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_MAXBURST``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:84
msgid "Memory store size"
msgstr "메모리 저장소 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:87
msgid ""
"The maximum number of user sessions connected to the system as determined"
" by vary rate limit settings when `rate limiting <#enable-rate-"
"limiting>`__ is enabled."
msgstr "`속도 제한 <#enable-rate-limiting>`__이 활성화된 경우 속도 제한 변경 설정에 의해 결정되는, 시스템에 연결된 최대 사용자 세션 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:91
msgid ""
"Numerical input. Default is **10000**. Typically set to the number of "
"users in the system."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **10000**입니다. 일반적으로 시스템의 사용자 수로 설정됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:94
msgid ""
"We recommend setting this value to the expected number of users. A higher"
" value may result in underutilized resources, and a lower value may "
"result in user sessions/tokens expiring too frequently."
msgstr "이 값을 예상 사용자 수로 설정하는 것을 권장합니다. 더 높은 값은 리소스가 충분히 활용되지 않게 할 수 있으며, 더 낮은 값은 사용자 세션/토큰이 너무 자주 만료되게 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:88
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``MemoryStoreSize`` > "
"``10000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``MemoryStoreSize`` > ``10000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:89
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_MEMORYSTORESIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_MEMORYSTORESIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:111
msgid "Vary rate limit by remote address"
msgstr "원격 주소별 속도 제한 변경"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:114
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to rate limit API access by IP address when `rate "
"limiting <#enable-rate-limiting>`__ is enabled."
msgstr "`속도 제한 <#enable-rate-limiting>`__이 활성화된 경우 IP 주소별로 API 접근을 속도 제한하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:117
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Rate limit API access by IP address. Recommended "
"when using a proxy."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** IP 주소별로 API 접근을 속도 제한합니다. 프록시를 사용할 때 권장됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:119
msgid "**false**: Rate limiting does not vary by IP address."
msgstr "**false**: 속도 제한이 IP 주소별로 달라지지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:115
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``VaryByRemoteAddr`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``VaryByRemoteAddr`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:116
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_VARYBYREMOTEADDR``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_VARYBYREMOTEADDR``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:132
msgid "Vary rate limit by user"
msgstr "사용자별 속도 제한 변경"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:135
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to rate limit API access by authentication token or "
"not when `rate limiting <#enable-rate-limiting>`__ is enabled."
msgstr "`속도 제한 <#enable-rate-limiting>`__이 활성화된 경우 인증 토큰별로 API 접근을 속도 제한할지 여부를 OKR.BEST에서 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:139
msgid ""
"**true**: Rate limit API access by user authentication token. Recommended"
" when using a proxy."
msgstr "**true**: 사용자 인증 토큰별로 API 접근을 속도 제한합니다. 프록시를 사용할 때 권장됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:141
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Rate limiting does not vary by user "
"authentication token."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 속도 제한이 사용자 인증 토큰별로 달라지지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:136
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``VaryByUser`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``VaryByUser`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:137
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_VARYBYUSER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_VARYBYUSER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:153
msgid "Vary rate limit by HTTP header"
msgstr "HTTP 헤더별 속도 제한 변경"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:156
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to vary rate limiting API access by the HTTP header "
"field specified. Recommended when you’re using a proxy."
msgstr "지정된 HTTP 헤더 필드별로 API 접근의 속도 제한을 변경하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다. 프록시를 사용할 때 권장됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:160
msgid "When configuring NGINX, set this to **X-Real-IP**."
msgstr "NGINX를 구성할 때, 이를 **X-Real-IP**로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:161
msgid "When configuring AmazonELB, set this to **X-Forwarded-For**."
msgstr "AmazonELB를 구성할 때, 이를 **X-Forwarded-For**로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:157
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``VaryByHeader`` > "
"``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``RateLimitSettings`` > ``VaryByHeader`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:158
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_VARYBYHEADER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_RATELIMITSETTINGS_VARYBYHEADER``"

